 "redBasisNote": "redBasis: what decided each red tag, from an offline replay of this arm at the current code (eval:replay), which gives the same tag as the recorded run on every case. by: reader-list = the code is in a model, lot or UPC list Nemotron's notice reader read; record-list = in the agency record's own field or its deterministic parse (openFDA code_info lots, UPCs and NDCs in the description); text = only in the notice's text (the matcher's fallback). how: exact, range (inside a printed range) or family (a family code). window: a made-date window was checked too. Every code a reader lists is also printed in the notice (lib/agent/verify-codes.ts), so reader-list says which path decided, not that only the reader could find it: the no-model arm (record-list and text only) is the comparison."
}
